        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    actor Staff as Student Affairs\n    participant UI as UserInterface (T6)\n    participant Importer as DataImporter\n    participant Repo as DataRepository\n    participant Updater as ScheduleUpdater\n\n    Staff-&gt;&gt;UI: select input file (FR 1, 3, 6, 14)\n    UI-&gt;&gt;Importer: importFile(filePath, fileType)\n    Importer-&gt;&gt;Importer: read file and skip title/empty lines (FR 23)\n    Importer-&gt;&gt;Repo: loadCurrentData(fileType)\n    Repo--&gt;&gt;Importer: currentData\n    Importer-&gt;&gt;Importer: check format and records (FR 24)\n\n    alt File has errors\n        Importer--&gt;&gt;UI: return error list (file, line, cause)\n        UI--&gt;&gt;Staff: show errors (nothing saved)\n    else File is valid\n        Importer-&gt;&gt;Importer: count added, changed, removed (FR 25)\n        Importer--&gt;&gt;UI: return change summary\n        UI--&gt;&gt;Staff: show summary and ask confirmation\n\n        alt User confirms\n            Staff-&gt;&gt;UI: confirm import\n            UI-&gt;&gt;Importer: confirmSave()\n            Importer-&gt;&gt;Repo: saveData(parsedData) (FR 3, 27, NFR 9)\n            Repo--&gt;&gt;Importer: saved\n            Importer-&gt;&gt;Updater: onDataChanged() (FR 26)\n            Updater-&gt;&gt;Repo: loadExamSchedule()\n            Repo--&gt;&gt;Updater: ExamSchedule\n\n            opt Schedule exists\n                Updater-&gt;&gt;Repo: markScheduleOutdated() (FR 26)\n                Repo--&gt;&gt;Updater: updated\n            end\n\n            Updater--&gt;&gt;Importer: done\n            Importer--&gt;&gt;UI: import complete\n            UI--&gt;&gt;Staff: refresh view and warn if outdated\n        else User cancels\n            Staff-&gt;&gt;UI: cancel import\n            UI--&gt;&gt;Staff: close window (nothing saved)\n        end\n    end&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null,&#xa;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;&#xa;}" id="gPl9BtxHJfpAv95ga1IV-161">
